  "notes": [
    "Owns the 58 additional printer driver files and the installed protection and comment of the shared Devs/Printers drawer.",
    "Aminet supplies three exact Epson Stylus and three exact HP DeskJet 68000 variants. The pinned BetterWB Bonus disk ZIP supplies 52 other driver paths, all corroborated by Gulliver's published Bonus ADF.",
    "Preserve the installed literal name HP_Laserjet_D.000 and the installed capitalization of Okimate_20.2 when copying from the archive.",
    "Fifteen AmigaOS drivers also live in Devs/Printers and stay OS-sourced. The printing-icons entry supplies the BCWB icon overlay."
  ],
